GUIDE
-----

`examples/incidents.csv` and `examples/grades.csv` are organisation 225 of
`GUIDE_Train.csv` from GUIDE, the Microsoft Security Incident Prediction
dataset (Microsoft, 2024), cut by `bench/slice.py`. The grades of the last
three days are moved from the first file to the second, and GUIDE's
placeholder ids for missing values are left blank.

